    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$2721600$",
      "worked": "Keep the vowel and consonant positions fixed. The six vowels are O, O, I, O, A, I; the nine consonants are P, R, P, R, T, N, L, T, Y.\n\nArrange the vowels and consonants independently, accounting for repeated letters:\n$$\\frac{6!}{3!\\times2!}\\times\\frac{9!}{2!\\times2!\\times2!}=2721600.$$",
